        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/steam-frame-games.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Valve has said its new Steam Frame VR headset, despite costing nearly &pound;900 for a base model, is intended to \"expand the market\" of virtual reality headsets. That's both because it's lightweight and standalone, but also because it addresses a fundamental and long-running problem VR headsets have had.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/valve-steam-frame-vr-demand-expand-market\">Read more</a></p>",
