        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/steam-frame-oops.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>And so here it is: Steam Frame; Valve's second in-house VR headset following 2019's Index, featuring a boosted spec sheet, PC-to-headset streaming, and the ability to function standalone. It is, if you don't mind spoilers, a good, often great bit of kit, and fascinating machine - lightweight and wonderfully comfortable, with some neat ideas, and a pleasure to use if you're doing PC-to-VR. As a standalone device, though, I have reservations, and there's a sense that here it's perhaps not <em>quite</em> ready for prime time.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/steam-frame-review\">Read more</a></p>",
