        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/starcraft-2030-blizzard-dan-hay.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>Blizzard has revealed more tangible details about what <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/starcraft-open-world-shooter-announced-blizzcon-2026\">the new StarCraft game</a> actually is, beyond it being an open-world shooter due for release in 2030. In doing so, Blizzard likened it to being more of a 'boxed' release rather than an ongoing live-service game, which is a notable departure for a company that has dealt almost exclusively in online multiplayer games.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/starcraft-shooter-2030-details-not-live-service\">Read more</a></p>",
